{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01H6EacaaR8oW9AsxXN9K4Du","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"gpqa_ds_importance_s020\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"GPQA importance masking s=0.20, DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B, n=198\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"n_problems\": 198,\n7\t      \"high_median_ii\": 0.035,\n8\t      \"mid_median_ii\": 0.28,\n9\t      \"low_median_ii\": 1.85,\n10\t      \"median_diff_low_minus_high\": 1.815,\n11\t      \"wilcoxon_p\": 2.5e-28,\n12\t      \"cohens_dz\": 0.72,\n13\t      \"ci_low\": 1.52,\n14\t      \"ci_high\": 2.18,\n15\t      \"monotonic\": true,\n16\t      \"phase_gradient_direction\": \"low > mid > high\",\n17\t      \"median_ratio_low_high\": 52.9\n18\t    },\n19\t    \"tables\": [\n20\t      {\n21\t        \"name\": \"GPQA DS Importance s020 Phase II\",\n22\t        \"columns\": [\n23\t          \"phase\",\n24\t          \"n_segments\",\n25\t          \"ii_median\",\n26\t          \"ii_mean\",\n27\t          \"ii_ci_low\",\n28\t          \"ii_ci_high\"\n29\t        ],\n30\t        \"rows\": [\n31\t          [\n32\t            \"high\",\n33\t            6261,\n34\t            0.035,\n35\t            0.42,\n36\t            0.12,\n37\t            0.95\n38\t          ],\n39\t          [\n40\t            \"mid\",\n41\t            2185,\n42\t            0.28,\n43\t            1.95,\n44\t            1.45,\n45\t            2.62\n46\t          ],\n47\t          [\n48\t            \"low\",\n49\t            5128,\n50\t            1.85,\n51\t            12.8,\n52\t            10.2,\n53\t            15.9\n54\t          ]\n55\t        ]\n56\t      }\n57\t    ],\n58\t    \"figures\": [],\n59\t    \"analysis\": \"虽然 monotonic 且显著，但 median_diff 仅 1.82，低于 MATH-500 同 sparsity 的 1.48 × 3(GPQA序列长度比) 的预期。暗示 GPQA 上 phase gradient 的 scaling behavior 不同于 MATH-500。\\n\\nGPQA 问题的推理链平均 ~6000 tokens (远长于 MATH-500 ~1200)，导致 low-sparsity phase 中可被 evict 的 critical token 绝对数量远多于 MATH-500。s020 compound interaction 在 GPQA 上产生 median_diff ~1.8，虽然方向与 MATH-500 一致 (MATH-500 s020=1.21)，但增长率从 MATH-500 的 s015→s020 3.1× 压缩为 GPQA 的 1.9×。原因：GPQA 多学科内容 (physics/chem/bio) 的 attention pattern 比纯数学推理更分散，head pruning 后的 discrimination collapse 在 s015 时已较充分——进一步增加 sparsity 的边际 collapse 效应递减。\"\n60\t  },\n61\t  {\n62\t    \"name\": \"gpqa_ds_importance_s025\",\n63\t    \"description\": \"GPQA importance masking s=0.25, DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B, n=198\",\n64\t    \"results\": {\n65\t      \"n_problems\": 198,\n66\t      \"high_median_ii\": 0.082,\n67\t      \"mid_median_ii\": 0.65,\n68\t      \"low_median_ii\": 2.58,\n69\t      \"median_diff_low_minus_high\": 2.498,\n70\t      \"wilcoxon_p\": 8.1e-32,\n71\t      \"cohens_dz\": 0.81,\n72\t      \"ci_low\": 2.05,\n73\t      \"ci_high\": 3.12,\n74\t      \"monotonic\": true,\n75\t      \"phase_gradient_direction\": \"low > mid > high\",\n76\t      \"dose_response_rho_s015_to_s025\": 1.0,\n77\t      \"growth_factor_vs_s020\": 1.38\n78\t    },\n79\t    \"tables\": [\n80\t      {\n81\t        \"name\": \"GPQA DS Importance s025 Phase II\",\n82\t        \"columns\": [\n83\t          \"phase\",\n84\t          \"n_segments\",\n85\t          \"ii_median\",\n86\t          \"ii_mean\",\n87\t          \"ii_ci_low\",\n88\t          \"ii_ci_high\"\n89\t        ],\n90\t        \"rows\": [\n91\t          [\n92\t            \"high\",\n93\t            6261,\n94\t            0.082,\n95\t            0.98,\n96\t            0.45,\n97\t            1.72\n98\t          ],\n99\t          [\n100\t            \"mid\",\n101\t            2185,\n102\t            0.65,\n103\t            4.8,\n104\t            3.2,\n105\t            6.9\n106\t          ],\n107\t          [\n108\t            \"low\",\n109\t            5128,\n110\t            2.58,\n111\t            28.5,\n112\t            21.3,\n113\t            37.8\n114\t          ]\n115\t        ]\n116\t      }\n117\t    ],\n118\t    \"figures\": [],\n119\t    \"analysis\": \"关键信号：GPQA gradient 增长 sub-linear 且远弱于 MATH-500。如果 s030 继续减速或反转，将确认 non-monotonicity。\\n\\ns025 在 GPQA 上仍保持 monotonic，但增长率急剧放缓 (s020→s025 仅 1.38× vs MATH-500 同区间 3.3×)。机制：GPQA 问题在 s025 compound sparsity 下，模型的 reasoning pathway 开始崩溃——不再尝试深度推理而转为浅层 pattern matching。这导致 low-sparsity phase 的 'reasoning content' 本身变少 (模型生成更短的 CoT)，压缩了 phase 间的 II 差异。同时 high-sparsity phase 的 II 也在上升 (0.013→0.035→0.082)，表明 compound interaction 开始渗透到 answer phase。\"\n120\t  },\n121\t  {\n122\t    \"name\": \"gpqa_ds_importance_s030\",\n123\t    \"description\": \"GPQA importance masking s=0.30, DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B, n=198\",\n124\t    \"results\": {\n125\t      \"n_problems\": 198,\n126\t      \"high_median_ii\": 0.155,\n127\t      \"mid_median_ii\": 0.82,\n128\t      \"low_median_ii\": 2.12,\n129\t      \"median_diff_low_minus_high\": 1.965,\n130\t      \"wilcoxon_p\": 3.7e-25,\n131\t      \"cohens_dz\": 0.62,\n132\t      \"ci_low\": 1.42,\n133\t      \"ci_high\": 2.68,\n134\t      \"monotonic\": true,\n135\t      \"phase_gradient_direction\": \"low > mid > high\",\n136\t      \"dose_response_rho_full\": 0.8,\n137\t      \"growth_factor_vs_s025\": 0.79,\n138\t      \"non_monotonic\": true,\n139\t      \"non_monotonic_note\": \"median_diff DECREASES from s025 (2.50) to s030 (1.97) — gradient SHRINKS at extreme sparsity\"\n140\t    },\n141\t    \"tables\": [\n142\t      {\n143\t        \"name\": \"GPQA DS Importance Dose-Response (Worst Tier)\",\n144\t        \"columns\": [\n145\t          \"sparsity\",\n146\t          \"median_diff\",\n147\t          \"growth_factor\",\n148\t          \"cohens_dz\",\n149\t          \"monotonic\"\n150\t        ],\n151\t        \"rows\": [\n152\t          [\n153\t            \"s015\",\n154\t            0.947,\n155\t            \"-\",\n156\t            0.68,\n157\t            true\n158\t          ],\n159\t          [\n160\t            \"s020\",\n161\t            1.815,\n162\t            \"1.92×\",\n163\t            0.72,\n164\t            true\n165\t          ],\n166\t          [\n167\t            \"s025\",\n168\t            2.498,\n169\t            \"1.38×\",\n170\t            0.81,\n171\t            true\n172\t          ],\n173\t          [\n174\t            \"s030\",\n175\t            1.965,\n176\t            \"0.79×\",\n177\t            0.62,\n178\t            \"NON-MONOTONIC (reversal)\"\n179\t          ]\n180\t        ]\n181\t      },\n182\t      {\n183\t        \"name\": \"Spearman ρ comparison across benchmarks\",\n184\t        \"columns\": [\n185\t          \"benchmark\",\n186\t          \"model\",\n187\t          \"dose_response_rho\",\n188\t          \"note\"\n189\t        ],\n190\t        \"rows\": [\n191\t          [\n192\t            \"MATH-500\",\n193\t            \"DeepSeek\",\n194\t            1.0,\n195\t            \"perfect monotonic\"\n196\t          ],\n197\t          [\n198\t            \"MATH-500\",\n199\t            \"Qwen\",\n200\t            1.0,\n201\t            \"perfect monotonic\"\n202\t          ],\n203\t          [\n204\t            \"GSM8K\",\n205\t            \"DeepSeek\",\n206\t            1.0,\n207\t            \"perfect monotonic\"\n208\t          ],\n209\t          [\n210\t            \"GSM8K\",\n211\t            \"Qwen\",\n212\t            1.0,\n213\t            \"perfect monotonic\"\n214\t          ],\n215\t          [\n216\t            \"GPQA\",\n217\t            \"DeepSeek\",\n218\t            0.8,\n219\t            \"NON-MONOTONIC at s030\"\n220\t          ]\n221\t        ]\n222\t      }\n223\t    ],\n224\t    \"figures\": [],\n225\t    \"analysis\": \"这是 worst tier 的核心证据：GPQA importance gradient 在 s030 出现 non-monotonicity (ρ=0.8)，直接否定了 'monotonic dose-response' 作为 universal property。解释为 ceiling effect + catastrophic collapse——strategy specificity 的前提 (importance gradient 远强于 random) 在 extreme GPQA compound 条件下不成立。\\n\\nNon-monotonicity 的机制：s030 extreme compound sparsity 导致 GPQA 上 BOTH phases 的 perplexity 飙升至 catastrophic level (both_ppl > 200 在 low phase)。此时 low-sparsity phase 的 II 增长遇到 ceiling effect (模型输出接近 random tokens，II 计算中的 ppl_both 分子/分母同时爆炸导致 ratio 压缩)，而 high-sparsity phase 的 II 继续上升 (因为 answer phase 也开始严重受损)。净效果：phase 间差异反而缩小。这与 recency s030 的 numerical instability 观察一致 (D102)，表明 extreme sparsity 下 phase gradient 本身变得 unreliable。GPQA 比 MATH-500 更早触及此 ceiling 因为其 baseline perplexity 更高 (dense low-phase ppl 1.42 vs MATH 1.23)。\"\n226\t  },\n227\t  {\n228\t    \"name\": \"gpqa_ds_random_s020\",\n229\t    \"description\": \"GPQA random masking s=0.20, DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B, n=198\",\n230\t    \"results\": {\n231\t      \"n_problems\": 198,\n232\t      \"high_median_ii\": 0.028,\n233\t      \"mid_median_ii\": 0.35,\n234\t      \"low_median_ii\": 1.42,\n235\t      \"median_diff_low_minus_high\": 1.392,\n236\t      \"wilcoxon_p\": 5.2e-22,\n237\t      \"cohens_dz\": 0.58,\n238\t      \"ci_low\": 1.05,\n239\t      \"ci_high\": 1.82,\n240\t      \"monotonic\": true,\n241\t      \"phase_gradient_significant\": true,\n242\t      \"imp_rand_ratio_s020\": 1.3\n243\t    },\n244\t    \"tables\": [\n245\t      {\n246\t        \"name\": \"GPQA Random s020 vs Importance s020\",\n247\t        \"columns\": [\n248\t          \"strategy\",\n249\t          \"high_median\",\n250\t          \"low_median\",\n251\t          \"median_diff\",\n252\t          \"dz\",\n253\t          \"p\"\n254\t        ],\n255\t        \"rows\": [\n256\t          [\n257\t            \"importance\",\n258\t            0.035,\n259\t            1.85,\n260\t            1.815,\n261\t            0.72,\n262\t            \"2.5e-28\"\n263\t          ],\n264\t          [\n265\t            \"random\",\n266\t            0.028,\n267\t            1.42,\n268\t            1.392,\n269\t            0.58,\n270\t            \"5.2e-22\"\n271\t          ],\n272\t          [\n273\t            \"ratio (imp/rand)\",\n274\t            \"-\",\n275\t            \"-\",\n276\t            \"1.30×\",\n277\t            \"1.24×\",\n278\t            \"-\"\n279\t          ]\n280\t        ]\n281\t      },\n282\t      {\n283\t        \"name\": \"Strategy Specificity Cross-Benchmark Comparison\",\n284\t        \"columns\": [\n285\t          \"benchmark\",\n286\t          \"model\",\n287\t          \"sparsity\",\n288\t          \"imp/rand_ratio\",\n289\t          \"interpretation\"\n290\t        ],\n291\t        \"rows\": [\n292\t          [\n293\t            \"MATH-500\",\n294\t            \"DeepSeek\",\n295\t            \"s025\",\n296\t            \"15.5×\",\n297\t            \"strong specificity\"\n298\t          ],\n299\t          [\n300\t            \"MATH-500\",\n301\t            \"DeepSeek\",\n302\t            \"s030\",\n303\t            \"16.6×\",\n304\t            \"strong specificity\"\n305\t          ],\n306\t          [\n307\t            \"MATH-500\",\n308\t            \"Qwen (n=500)\",\n309\t            \"s025\",\n310\t            \"2.7×\",\n311\t            \"weak specificity\"\n312\t          ],\n313\t          [\n314\t            \"GSM8K\",\n315\t            \"DeepSeek\",\n316\t            \"s025\",\n317\t            \"3.8×\",\n318\t            \"moderate\"\n319\t          ],\n320\t          [\n321\t            \"GSM8K\",\n322\t            \"DeepSeek\",\n323\t            \"s030\",\n324\t            \"2.8×\",\n325\t            \"weak\"\n326\t          ],\n327\t          [\n328\t            \"GPQA\",\n329\t            \"DeepSeek\",\n330\t            \"s020\",\n331\t            \"1.30×\",\n332\t            \"NO specificity\"\n333\t          ],\n334\t          [\n335\t            \"LLaMA\",\n336\t            \"LLaMA-8B\",\n337\t            \"s025\",\n338\t            \"2.0×\",\n339\t            \"weak\"\n340\t          ]\n341\t        ]\n342\t      }\n343\t    ],\n344\t    \"figures\": [],\n345\t    \"analysis\": \"GPQA random 的强 phase gradient 确认：phase vulnerability 是 compound sparsity 的 intrinsic property (universal)，不是 importance strategy 的 specific behavior。核心叙事必须重构。\\n\\nGPQA random eviction 在 s020 产生显著 phase gradient (d_z=0.58 > 0.5 threshold)，与 MATH-500 s020 random 的 NS 结果 (median_diff=-0.016, FAIL) 形成鲜明对比。机制：GPQA 推理链极长 (~6000 tokens)，low-sparsity phase 占据大量序列位置。Random eviction 在长序列上有更高概率命中关键 reasoning token——这是一个纯粹的 combinatorial effect (更长序列 = 更多 critical tokens = 随机删除更可能破坏推理链)，与 importance score 的 discriminability 无关。换言之，GPQA 的 phase gradient 主要由 'phase duration asymmetry × random hit probability' 驱动，而非 strategy-specific discrimination collapse。imp/rand ratio 仅 1.30× 表明 importance 相比 random 几乎没有额外的 phase-specific damage——所谓 'strategy specificity' 在 GPQA 上 collapse。\"\n346\t  },\n347\t  {\n348\t    \"name\": \"gpqa_ds_random_s015\",\n349\t    \"description\": \"GPQA random masking s=0.15, DeepSeek (needed for complete ratio comparison)\",\n350\t    \"results\": {\n351\t      \"n_problems\": 198,\n352\t      \"high_median_ii\": 0.015,\n353\t      \"mid_median_ii\": 0.18,\n354\t      \"low_median_ii\": 0.72,\n355\t      \"median_diff_low_minus_high\": 0.705,\n356\t      \"wilcoxon_p\": 8.3e-16,\n357\t      \"cohens_dz\": 0.52,\n358\t      \"ci_low\": 0.48,\n359\t      \"ci_high\": 0.95,\n360\t      \"monotonic\": true,\n361\t      \"phase_gradient_significant\": true,\n362\t      \"imp_rand_ratio_s015\": 1.34\n363\t    },\n364\t    \"tables\": [],\n365\t    \"figures\": [],\n366\t    \"analysis\": \"与 MATH-500 random s015 NS 的 qualitative difference 确认 phase gradient universality 是 task/sequence-length dependent 而非 strategy-specific。\\n\\n即使在低 sparsity s015，GPQA random 已显示显著 phase gradient (d_z=0.52)。对比 MATH-500 s015 random 完全 NS (median_diff=0.0095, FAIL)。原因同上：GPQA 序列长度导致 random eviction 的 combinatorial hit probability 在 low-sparsity reasoning phase 远高于 MATH-500。imp/rand ratio 1.34× 表明在所有 GPQA sparsity level 上 strategy specificity 都不成立。\"\n367\t  },\n368\t  {\n369\t    \"name\": \"gpqa_ds_random_s025\",\n370\t    \"description\": \"GPQA random masking s=0.25, DeepSeek (needed for full dose-response)\",\n371\t    \"results\": {\n372\t      \"n_problems\": 198,\n373\t      \"high_median_ii\": 0.065,\n374\t      \"mid_median_ii\": 0.72,\n375\t      \"low_median_ii\": 1.95,\n376\t      \"median_diff_low_minus_high\": 1.885,\n377\t      \"wilcoxon_p\": 1.1e-26,\n378\t      \"cohens_dz\": 0.62,\n379\t      \"ci_low\": 1.48,\n380\t      \"ci_high\": 2.35,\n381\t      \"monotonic\": true,\n382\t      \"imp_rand_ratio_s025\": 1.33\n383\t    },\n384\t    \"tables\": [\n385\t      {\n386\t        \"name\": \"GPQA Dose-Response: Importance vs Random\",\n387\t        \"columns\": [\n388\t          \"sparsity\",\n389\t          \"imp_median_diff\",\n390\t          \"rand_median_diff\",\n391\t          \"ratio\",\n392\t          \"MATH500_ratio\"\n393\t        ],\n394\t        \"rows\": [\n395\t          [\n396\t            \"s015\",\n397\t            0.947,\n398\t            0.705,\n399\t            \"1.34×\",\n400\t            \"28.1× (NS)\"\n401\t          ],\n402\t          [\n403\t            \"s020\",\n404\t            1.815,\n405\t            1.392,\n406\t            \"1.30×\",\n407\t            \"38.6× (NS)\"\n408\t          ],\n409\t          [\n410\t            \"s025\",\n411\t            2.498,\n412\t            1.885,\n413\t            \"1.33×\",\n414\t            \"15.5×\"\n415\t          ],\n416\t          [\n417\t            \"s030\",\n418\t            1.965,\n419\t            1.62,\n420\t            \"1.21×\",\n421\t            \"16.6×\"\n422\t          ]\n423\t        ]\n424\t      }\n425\t    ],\n426\t    \"figures\": [],\n427\t    \"analysis\": \"Strategy specificity 在 GPQA 全 4 个 sparsity 上均 <1.5×。这是 worst tier 的 decisive evidence。\\n\\nRandom s025 的 median_diff (1.89) 甚至接近 importance s025 (2.50)。ratio 仅 1.33×。在 MATH-500 s025 上 imp/rand ratio 是 15.5× (DS n=500)。这一 ~12× 的 ratio 衰减 (15.5→1.33) 彻底瓦解了 strategy specificity 作为 general finding 的地位。机制：GPQA 问题的 attention score landscape 在 s025 compound 条件下已极度 flat (discrimination collapse 更彻底)，导致 importance eviction 退化为 quasi-random——两种 strategy 在行为上趋同。\"\n428\t  },\n429\t  {\n430\t    \"name\": \"gpqa_ds_random_s030\",\n431\t    \"description\": \"GPQA random masking s=0.30, DeepSeek (needed for full picture)\",\n432\t    \"results\": {\n433\t      \"n_problems\": 198,\n434\t      \"high_median_ii\": 0.12,\n435\t      \"mid_median_ii\": 0.85,\n436\t      \"low_median_ii\": 1.74,\n437\t      \"median_diff_low_minus_high\": 1.62,\n438\t      \"wilcoxon_p\": 7.8e-20,\n439\t      \"cohens_dz\": 0.53,\n440\t      \"ci_low\": 1.15,\n441\t      \"ci_high\": 2.18,\n442\t      \"monotonic\": true,\n443\t      \"imp_rand_ratio_s030\": 1.21,\n444\t      \"random_also_non_monotonic\": true,\n445\t      \"random_rho\": 0.8\n446\t    },\n447\t    \"tables\": [\n448\t      {\n449\t        \"name\": \"GPQA Random Full Dose-Response\",\n450\t        \"columns\": [\n451\t          \"sparsity\",\n452\t          \"median_diff\",\n453\t          \"dz\",\n454\t          \"p\",\n455\t          \"monotonic_cumulative\"\n456\t        ],\n457\t        \"rows\": [\n458\t          [\n459\t            \"s015\",\n460\t            0.705,\n461\t            0.52,\n462\t            \"8.3e-16\",\n463\t            \"yes\"\n464\t          ],\n465\t          [\n466\t            \"s020\",\n467\t            1.392,\n468\t            0.58,\n469\t            \"5.2e-22\",\n470\t            \"yes\"\n471\t          ],\n472\t          [\n473\t            \"s025\",\n474\t            1.885,\n475\t            0.62,\n476\t            \"1.1e-26\",\n477\t            \"yes\"\n478\t          ],\n479\t          [\n480\t            \"s030\",\n481\t            1.62,\n482\t            0.53,\n483\t            \"7.8e-20\",\n484\t            \"NON-MONOTONIC (peak at s025)\"\n485\t          ]\n486\t        ]\n487\t      }\n488\t    ],\n489\t    \"figures\": [],\n490\t    \"analysis\": \"Random 和 importance 的 parallel non-monotonicity 是 worst tier 最强证据——任何基于 'strategy-specific' 的 narrative 都无法解释为什么两种完全不同的 eviction 方法产生相同的 dose-response shape。\\n\\nRandom 在 s030 同样出现增长放缓 (s025 1.89 → s030 1.62, growth factor 0.86×)，与 importance 的 non-monotonicity 平行。这进一步确认：non-monotonicity 不是 importance-specific behavior 而是 GPQA + extreme sparsity 的 ceiling/collapse effect。两种 strategy 的 phase gradient 同步衰减表明驱动因素是 task-level 的 (reasoning chain 在 extreme compound sparsity 下崩溃导致 phase structure 本身消失)，而非 strategy-level 的。imp/rand ratio 在 s030 降至最低 (1.21×)——strategy 完全不可区分。\"\n491\t  },\n492\t  {\n493\t    \"name\": \"cross_benchmark_strategy_specificity_synthesis\",\n494\t    \"description\": \"综合分析：跨 4 benchmarks × 3 models 的 strategy specificity 汇总\",\n495\t    \"results\": {\n496\t      \"conditions_with_strong_specificity\": 1,\n497\t      \"conditions_with_moderate_specificity\": 1,\n498\t      \"conditions_with_weak_or_no_specificity\": 5,\n499\t      \"cross_benchmark_gradient_correlation\": 0.72,\n500\t      \"strategy_specificity_fraction\": \"1/7 (14%)\",\n501\t      \"expected_reviewer_avg_score\": 2.8,\n502\t      \"novelty_score\": 2.7\n503\t    },\n504\t    \"tables\": [\n505\t      {\n506\t        \"name\": \"Strategy Specificity Summary (All Conditions)\",\n507\t        \"columns\": [\n508\t          \"benchmark\",\n509\t          \"model\",\n510\t          \"best_sparsity_ratio\",\n511\t          \"classification\"\n512\t        ],\n513\t        \"rows\": [\n514\t          [\n515\t            \"MATH-500\",\n516\t            \"DeepSeek-7B\",\n517\t            \"15.5-16.6×\",\n518\t            \"STRONG\"\n519\t          ],\n520\t          [\n521\t            \"MATH-500\",\n522\t            \"Qwen-7B (n=500)\",\n523\t            \"2.7×\",\n524\t            \"WEAK\"\n525\t          ],\n526\t          [\n527\t            \"MATH-500\",\n528\t            \"LLaMA-8B (n=250)\",\n529\t            \"2.0-2.6×\",\n530\t            \"WEAK\"\n531\t          ],\n532\t          [\n533\t            \"GSM8K\",\n534\t            \"DeepSeek-7B\",\n535\t            \"2.3-3.8×\",\n536\t            \"MODERATE-WEAK\"\n537\t          ],\n538\t          [\n539\t            \"GSM8K\",\n540\t            \"Qwen-7B\",\n541\t            \"~2.5×\",\n542\t            \"WEAK\"\n543\t          ],\n544\t          [\n545\t            \"GPQA\",\n546\t            \"DeepSeek-7B\",\n547\t            \"1.2-1.3×\",\n548\t            \"NONE\"\n549\t          ]\n550\t        ]\n551\t      },\n552\t      {\n553\t        \"name\": \"Revised Paper Claim Structure (Worst Tier)\",\n554\t        \"columns\": [\n555\t          \"claim\",\n556\t          \"status_revision\",\n557\t          \"note\"\n558\t        ],\n559\t        \"rows\": [\n560\t          [\n561\t            \"Phase gradient universality\",\n562\t            \"PRIMARY (upgraded)\",\n563\t            \"All strategies (except recency) show phase gradient on all benchmarks\"\n564\t          ],\n565\t          [\n566\t            \"Strategy specificity\",\n567\t            \"SECONDARY (downgraded)\",\n568\t            \"Only MATH-500 DeepSeek; task/architecture dependent\"\n569\t          ],\n570\t          [\n571\t            \"Recency as phase-robust control\",\n572\t            \"PRIMARY (retained)\",\n573\t            \"Still unique: only strategy with NS across all sparsities\"\n574\t          ],\n575\t          [\n576\t            \"Discrimination collapse\",\n577\t            \"MECHANISM (retained)\",\n578\t            \"Explains why importance ≥ random even when ratio small\"\n579\t          ],\n580\t          [\n581\t            \"Dose-response monotonicity\",\n582\t            \"QUALIFIED\",\n583\t            \"Holds for MATH-500/GSM8K; non-monotonic on GPQA at extreme sparsity\"\n584\t          ]\n585\t        ]\n586\t      }\n587\t    ],\n588\t    \"figures\": [],\n589\t    \"analysis\": \"在 worst tier 下，论文需要完全重构。核心贡献变为：(1) 首次量化 compound sparsity 的 phase vulnerability 是 universal property (所有 non-recency strategy 在所有 benchmark 上均显示)，(2) recency 作为唯一 immune strategy 的 practical design implication，(3) strategy specificity 作为 task/architecture-dependent secondary phenomenon。Reviewer 预期反应：'interesting empirical observation but incremental—once you measure phase gradient for random you see it's not strategy-specific, so the whole discrimination collapse story becomes auxiliary rather than central。' Expected score ~2.8, borderline for EMNLP。需要加强 practical implication (e.g., phase-aware compression guideline) 来弥补 novelty 不足。\\n\\n汇总所有条件后，'strategy-specific phase interaction' 仅在单一条件 (MATH-500 DeepSeek, 15-17×) 成立。其余 6/7 条件的 imp/rand ratio 均 ≤3.8×，其中 GPQA 全部 <1.5×。Reviewers 会合理质疑：如果核心 claim 仅在一个 (model, benchmark) pair 上强，这是 robust finding 还是 idiosyncratic artifact？cross_benchmark_gradient_correlation 0.72 表明 phase gradient 本身跨 benchmark 存在 (moderate correlation)，但 strategy modulation 不 generalizable。预期 reviewer scores: Novelty 2.7 (phase gradient universality 有一定新意但被视为 'obvious once you measure it')，Soundness 3.0 (统计严格)，Significance 2.5 (practical impact unclear without method paper)，Overall 2.8。\"\n590\t  }\n591\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cbe83670-1763-4df0-a729-5b95d9e54139","uuid":"f65b83dc-31ca-43d2-9274-7c31ad6795a0","timestamp":"2026-05-17T03:49:38.128Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_11/projects/phase-gated-compound-sparse/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260517T032843/worst/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"gpqa_ds_importance_s020\",\n    \"description\": \"GPQA importance masking s=0.20, DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B, n=198\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_problems\": 198,\n      \"high_median_ii\": 0.035,\n      \"mid_median_ii\": 0.28,\n      \"low_median_ii\": 1.85,\n      \"median_diff_low_minus_high\": 1.815,\n      \"wilcoxon_p\": 2.5e-28,\n      \"cohens_dz\": 0.72,\n      \"ci_low\": 1.52,\n      \"ci_high\": 2.18,\n      \"monotonic\": true,\n      \"phase_gradient_direction\": \"low > mid > high\",\n      \"median_ratio_low_high\": 52.9\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"GPQA DS Importance s020 Phase II\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"phase\",\n          \"n_segments\",\n          \"ii_median\",\n          \"ii_mean\",\n          \"ii_ci_low\",\n          \"ii_ci_high\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"high\",\n            6261,\n            0.035,\n            0.42,\n            0.12,\n            0.95\n          ],\n          [\n            \"mid\",\n            2185,\n            0.28,\n            1.95,\n            1.45,\n            2.62\n          ],\n          [\n            \"low\",\n            5128,\n            1.85,\n            12.8,\n            10.2,\n            15.9\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"虽然 monotonic 且显著，但 median_diff 仅 1.82，低于 MATH-500 同 sparsity 的 1.48 × 3(GPQA序列长度比) 的预期。暗示 GPQA 上 phase gradient 的 scaling behavior 不同于 MATH-500。\\n\\nGPQA 问题的推理链平均 ~6000 tokens (远长于 MATH-500 ~1200)，导致 low-sparsity phase 中可被 evict 的 critical token 绝对数量远多于 MATH-500。s020 compound interaction 在 GPQA 上产生 median_diff ~1.8，虽然方向与 MATH-500 一致 (MATH-500 s020=1.21)，但增长率从 MATH-500 的 s015→s020 3.1× 压缩为 GPQA 的 1.9×。原因：GPQA 多学科内容 (physics/chem/bio) 的 attention pattern 比纯数学推理更分散，head pruning 后的 discrimination collapse 在 s015 时已较充分——进一步增加 sparsity 的边际 collapse 效应递减。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"gpqa_ds_importance_s025\",\n    \"description\": \"GPQA importance masking s=0.25, DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B, n=198\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_problems\": 198,\n      \"high_median_ii\": 0.082,\n      \"mid_median_ii\": 0.65,\n      \"low_median_ii\": 2.58,\n      \"median_diff_low_minus_high\": 2.498,\n      \"wilcoxon_p\": 8.1e-32,\n      \"cohens_dz\": 0.81,\n      \"ci_low\": 2.05,\n      \"ci_high\": 3.12,\n      \"monotonic\": true,\n      \"phase_gradient_direction\": \"low > mid > high\",\n      \"dose_response_rho_s015_to_s025\": 1.0,\n      \"growth_factor_vs_s020\": 1.38\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"GPQA DS Importance s025 Phase II\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"phase\",\n          \"n_segments\",\n          \"ii_median\",\n          \"ii_mean\",\n          \"ii_ci_low\",\n          \"ii_ci_high\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"high\",\n            6261,\n            0.082,\n            0.98,\n            0.45,\n            1.72\n          ],\n          [\n            \"mid\",\n            2185,\n            0.65,\n            4.8,\n            3.2,\n            6.9\n          ],\n          [\n            \"low\",\n            5128,\n            2.58,\n            28.5,\n            21.3,\n            37.8\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"关键信号：GPQA gradient 增长 sub-linear 且远弱于 MATH-500。如果 s030 继续减速或反转，将确认 non-monotonicity。\\n\\ns025 在 GPQA 上仍保持 monotonic，但增长率急剧放缓 (s020→s025 仅 1.38× vs MATH-500 同区间 3.3×)。机制：GPQA 问题在 s025 compound sparsity 下，模型的 reasoning pathway 开始崩溃——不再尝试深度推理而转为浅层 pattern matching。这导致 low-sparsity phase 的 'reasoning content' 本身变少 (模型生成更短的 CoT)，压缩了 phase 间的 II 差异。同时 high-sparsity phase 的 II 也在上升 (0.013→0.035→0.082)，表明 compound interaction 开始渗透到 answer phase。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"gpqa_ds_importance_s030\",\n    \"description\": \"GPQA importance masking s=0.30, DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B, n=198\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_problems\": 198,\n      \"high_median_ii\": 0.155,\n      \"mid_median_ii\": 0.82,\n      \"low_median_ii\": 2.12,\n      \"median_diff_low_minus_high\": 1.965,\n      \"wilcoxon_p\": 3.7e-25,\n      \"cohens_dz\": 0.62,\n      \"ci_low\": 1.42,\n      \"ci_high\": 2.68,\n      \"monotonic\": true,\n      \"phase_gradient_direction\": \"low > mid > high\",\n      \"dose_response_rho_full\": 0.8,\n      \"growth_factor_vs_s025\": 0.79,\n      \"non_monotonic\": true,\n      \"non_monotonic_note\": \"median_diff DECREASES from s025 (2.50) to s030 (1.97) — gradient SHRINKS at extreme sparsity\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"GPQA DS Importance Dose-Response (Worst Tier)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"sparsity\",\n          \"median_diff\",\n          \"growth_factor\",\n          \"cohens_dz\",\n          \"monotonic\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"s015\",\n            0.947,\n            \"-\",\n            0.68,\n            true\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s020\",\n            1.815,\n            \"1.92×\",\n            0.72,\n            true\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s025\",\n            2.498,\n            \"1.38×\",\n            0.81,\n            true\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s030\",\n            1.965,\n            \"0.79×\",\n            0.62,\n            \"NON-MONOTONIC (reversal)\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Spearman ρ comparison across benchmarks\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"benchmark\",\n          \"model\",\n          \"dose_response_rho\",\n          \"note\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"MATH-500\",\n            \"DeepSeek\",\n            1.0,\n            \"perfect monotonic\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"MATH-500\",\n            \"Qwen\",\n            1.0,\n            \"perfect monotonic\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"GSM8K\",\n            \"DeepSeek\",\n            1.0,\n            \"perfect monotonic\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"GSM8K\",\n            \"Qwen\",\n            1.0,\n            \"perfect monotonic\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"GPQA\",\n            \"DeepSeek\",\n            0.8,\n            \"NON-MONOTONIC at s030\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"这是 worst tier 的核心证据：GPQA importance gradient 在 s030 出现 non-monotonicity (ρ=0.8)，直接否定了 'monotonic dose-response' 作为 universal property。解释为 ceiling effect + catastrophic collapse——strategy specificity 的前提 (importance gradient 远强于 random) 在 extreme GPQA compound 条件下不成立。\\n\\nNon-monotonicity 的机制：s030 extreme compound sparsity 导致 GPQA 上 BOTH phases 的 perplexity 飙升至 catastrophic level (both_ppl > 200 在 low phase)。此时 low-sparsity phase 的 II 增长遇到 ceiling effect (模型输出接近 random tokens，II 计算中的 ppl_both 分子/分母同时爆炸导致 ratio 压缩)，而 high-sparsity phase 的 II 继续上升 (因为 answer phase 也开始严重受损)。净效果：phase 间差异反而缩小。这与 recency s030 的 numerical instability 观察一致 (D102)，表明 extreme sparsity 下 phase gradient 本身变得 unreliable。GPQA 比 MATH-500 更早触及此 ceiling 因为其 baseline perplexity 更高 (dense low-phase ppl 1.42 vs MATH 1.23)。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"gpqa_ds_random_s020\",\n    \"description\": \"GPQA random masking s=0.20, DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B, n=198\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_problems\": 198,\n      \"high_median_ii\": 0.028,\n      \"mid_median_ii\": 0.35,\n      \"low_median_ii\": 1.42,\n      \"median_diff_low_minus_high\": 1.392,\n      \"wilcoxon_p\": 5.2e-22,\n      \"cohens_dz\": 0.58,\n      \"ci_low\": 1.05,\n      \"ci_high\": 1.82,\n      \"monotonic\": true,\n      \"phase_gradient_significant\": true,\n      \"imp_rand_ratio_s020\": 1.3\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"GPQA Random s020 vs Importance s020\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"strategy\",\n          \"high_median\",\n          \"low_median\",\n          \"median_diff\",\n          \"dz\",\n          \"p\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"importance\",\n            0.035,\n            1.85,\n            1.815,\n            0.72,\n            \"2.5e-28\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"random\",\n            0.028,\n            1.42,\n            1.392,\n            0.58,\n            \"5.2e-22\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"ratio (imp/rand)\",\n            \"-\",\n            \"-\",\n            \"1.30×\",\n            \"1.24×\",\n            \"-\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Strategy Specificity Cross-Benchmark Comparison\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"benchmark\",\n          \"model\",\n          \"sparsity\",\n          \"imp/rand_ratio\",\n          \"interpretation\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"MATH-500\",\n            \"DeepSeek\",\n            \"s025\",\n            \"15.5×\",\n            \"strong specificity\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"MATH-500\",\n            \"DeepSeek\",\n            \"s030\",\n            \"16.6×\",\n            \"strong specificity\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"MATH-500\",\n            \"Qwen (n=500)\",\n            \"s025\",\n            \"2.7×\",\n            \"weak specificity\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"GSM8K\",\n            \"DeepSeek\",\n            \"s025\",\n            \"3.8×\",\n            \"moderate\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"GSM8K\",\n            \"DeepSeek\",\n            \"s030\",\n            \"2.8×\",\n            \"weak\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"GPQA\",\n            \"DeepSeek\",\n            \"s020\",\n            \"1.30×\",\n            \"NO specificity\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"LLaMA\",\n            \"LLaMA-8B\",\n            \"s025\",\n            \"2.0×\",\n            \"weak\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"GPQA random 的强 phase gradient 确认：phase vulnerability 是 compound sparsity 的 intrinsic property (universal)，不是 importance strategy 的 specific behavior。核心叙事必须重构。\\n\\nGPQA random eviction 在 s020 产生显著 phase gradient (d_z=0.58 > 0.5 threshold)，与 MATH-500 s020 random 的 NS 结果 (median_diff=-0.016, FAIL) 形成鲜明对比。机制：GPQA 推理链极长 (~6000 tokens)，low-sparsity phase 占据大量序列位置。Random eviction 在长序列上有更高概率命中关键 reasoning token——这是一个纯粹的 combinatorial effect (更长序列 = 更多 critical tokens = 随机删除更可能破坏推理链)，与 importance score 的 discriminability 无关。换言之，GPQA 的 phase gradient 主要由 'phase duration asymmetry × random hit probability' 驱动，而非 strategy-specific discrimination collapse。imp/rand ratio 仅 1.30× 表明 importance 相比 random 几乎没有额外的 phase-specific damage——所谓 'strategy specificity' 在 GPQA 上 collapse。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"gpqa_ds_random_s015\",\n    \"description\": \"GPQA random masking s=0.15, DeepSeek (needed for complete ratio comparison)\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_problems\": 198,\n      \"high_median_ii\": 0.015,\n      \"mid_median_ii\": 0.18,\n      \"low_median_ii\": 0.72,\n      \"median_diff_low_minus_high\": 0.705,\n      \"wilcoxon_p\": 8.3e-16,\n      \"cohens_dz\": 0.52,\n      \"ci_low\": 0.48,\n      \"ci_high\": 0.95,\n      \"monotonic\": true,\n      \"phase_gradient_significant\": true,\n      \"imp_rand_ratio_s015\": 1.34\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"与 MATH-500 random s015 NS 的 qualitative difference 确认 phase gradient universality 是 task/sequence-length dependent 而非 strategy-specific。\\n\\n即使在低 sparsity s015，GPQA random 已显示显著 phase gradient (d_z=0.52)。对比 MATH-500 s015 random 完全 NS (median_diff=0.0095, FAIL)。原因同上：GPQA 序列长度导致 random eviction 的 combinatorial hit probability 在 low-sparsity reasoning phase 远高于 MATH-500。imp/rand ratio 1.34× 表明在所有 GPQA sparsity level 上 strategy specificity 都不成立。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"gpqa_ds_random_s025\",\n    \"description\": \"GPQA random masking s=0.25, DeepSeek (needed for full dose-response)\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_problems\": 198,\n      \"high_median_ii\": 0.065,\n      \"mid_median_ii\": 0.72,\n      \"low_median_ii\": 1.95,\n      \"median_diff_low_minus_high\": 1.885,\n      \"wilcoxon_p\": 1.1e-26,\n      \"cohens_dz\": 0.62,\n      \"ci_low\": 1.48,\n      \"ci_high\": 2.35,\n      \"monotonic\": true,\n      \"imp_rand_ratio_s025\": 1.33\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"GPQA Dose-Response: Importance vs Random\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"sparsity\",\n          \"imp_median_diff\",\n          \"rand_median_diff\",\n          \"ratio\",\n          \"MATH500_ratio\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"s015\",\n            0.947,\n            0.705,\n            \"1.34×\",\n            \"28.1× (NS)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s020\",\n            1.815,\n            1.392,\n            \"1.30×\",\n            \"38.6× (NS)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s025\",\n            2.498,\n            1.885,\n            \"1.33×\",\n            \"15.5×\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s030\",\n            1.965,\n            1.62,\n            \"1.21×\",\n            \"16.6×\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Strategy specificity 在 GPQA 全 4 个 sparsity 上均 <1.5×。这是 worst tier 的 decisive evidence。\\n\\nRandom s025 的 median_diff (1.89) 甚至接近 importance s025 (2.50)。ratio 仅 1.33×。在 MATH-500 s025 上 imp/rand ratio 是 15.5× (DS n=500)。这一 ~12× 的 ratio 衰减 (15.5→1.33) 彻底瓦解了 strategy specificity 作为 general finding 的地位。机制：GPQA 问题的 attention score landscape 在 s025 compound 条件下已极度 flat (discrimination collapse 更彻底)，导致 importance eviction 退化为 quasi-random——两种 strategy 在行为上趋同。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"gpqa_ds_random_s030\",\n    \"description\": \"GPQA random masking s=0.30, DeepSeek (needed for full picture)\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_problems\": 198,\n      \"high_median_ii\": 0.12,\n      \"mid_median_ii\": 0.85,\n      \"low_median_ii\": 1.74,\n      \"median_diff_low_minus_high\": 1.62,\n      \"wilcoxon_p\": 7.8e-20,\n      \"cohens_dz\": 0.53,\n      \"ci_low\": 1.15,\n      \"ci_high\": 2.18,\n      \"monotonic\": true,\n      \"imp_rand_ratio_s030\": 1.21,\n      \"random_also_non_monotonic\": true,\n      \"random_rho\": 0.8\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"GPQA Random Full Dose-Response\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"sparsity\",\n          \"median_diff\",\n          \"dz\",\n          \"p\",\n          \"monotonic_cumulative\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"s015\",\n            0.705,\n            0.52,\n            \"8.3e-16\",\n            \"yes\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s020\",\n            1.392,\n            0.58,\n            \"5.2e-22\",\n            \"yes\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s025\",\n            1.885,\n            0.62,\n            \"1.1e-26\",\n            \"yes\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s030\",\n            1.62,\n            0.53,\n            \"7.8e-20\",\n            \"NON-MONOTONIC (peak at s025)\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Random 和 importance 的 parallel non-monotonicity 是 worst tier 最强证据——任何基于 'strategy-specific' 的 narrative 都无法解释为什么两种完全不同的 eviction 方法产生相同的 dose-response shape。\\n\\nRandom 在 s030 同样出现增长放缓 (s025 1.89 → s030 1.62, growth factor 0.86×)，与 importance 的 non-monotonicity 平行。这进一步确认：non-monotonicity 不是 importance-specific behavior 而是 GPQA + extreme sparsity 的 ceiling/collapse effect。两种 strategy 的 phase gradient 同步衰减表明驱动因素是 task-level 的 (reasoning chain 在 extreme compound sparsity 下崩溃导致 phase structure 本身消失)，而非 strategy-level 的。imp/rand ratio 在 s030 降至最低 (1.21×)——strategy 完全不可区分。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"cross_benchmark_strategy_specificity_synthesis\",\n    \"description\": \"综合分析：跨 4 benchmarks × 3 models 的 strategy specificity 汇总\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"conditions_with_strong_specificity\": 1,\n      \"conditions_with_moderate_specificity\": 1,\n      \"conditions_with_weak_or_no_specificity\": 5,\n      \"cross_benchmark_gradient_correlation\": 0.72,\n      \"strategy_specificity_fraction\": \"1/7 (14%)\",\n      \"expected_reviewer_avg_score\": 2.8,\n      \"novelty_score\": 2.7\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Strategy Specificity Summary (All Conditions)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"benchmark\",\n          \"model\",\n          \"best_sparsity_ratio\",\n          \"classification\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"MATH-500\",\n            \"DeepSeek-7B\",\n            \"15.5-16.6×\",\n            \"STRONG\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"MATH-500\",\n            \"Qwen-7B (n=500)\",\n            \"2.7×\",\n            \"WEAK\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"MATH-500\",\n            \"LLaMA-8B (n=250)\",\n            \"2.0-2.6×\",\n            \"WEAK\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"GSM8K\",\n            \"DeepSeek-7B\",\n            \"2.3-3.8×\",\n            \"MODERATE-WEAK\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"GSM8K\",\n            \"Qwen-7B\",\n            \"~2.5×\",\n            \"WEAK\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"GPQA\",\n            \"DeepSeek-7B\",\n            \"1.2-1.3×\",\n            \"NONE\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Revised Paper Claim Structure (Worst Tier)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"claim\",\n          \"status_revision\",\n          \"note\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Phase gradient universality\",\n            \"PRIMARY (upgraded)\",\n            \"All strategies (except recency) show phase gradient on all benchmarks\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Strategy specificity\",\n            \"SECONDARY (downgraded)\",\n            \"Only MATH-500 DeepSeek; task/architecture dependent\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Recency as phase-robust control\",\n            \"PRIMARY (retained)\",\n            \"Still unique: only strategy with NS across all sparsities\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Discrimination collapse\",\n            \"MECHANISM (retained)\",\n            \"Explains why importance ≥ random even when ratio small\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Dose-response monotonicity\",\n            \"QUALIFIED\",\n            \"Holds for MATH-500/GSM8K; non-monotonic on GPQA at extreme sparsity\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"在 worst tier 下，论文需要完全重构。核心贡献变为：(1) 首次量化 compound sparsity 的 phase vulnerability 是 universal property (所有 non-recency strategy 在所有 benchmark 上均显示)，(2) recency 作为唯一 immune strategy 的 practical design implication，(3) strategy specificity 作为 task/architecture-dependent secondary phenomenon。Reviewer 预期反应：'interesting empirical observation but incremental—once you measure phase gradient for random you see it's not strategy-specific, so the whole discrimination collapse story becomes auxiliary rather than central。' Expected score ~2.8, borderline for EMNLP。需要加强 practical implication (e.g., phase-aware compression guideline) 来弥补 novelty 不足。\\n\\n汇总所有条件后，'strategy-specific phase interaction' 仅在单一条件 (MATH-500 DeepSeek, 15-17×) 成立。其余 6/7 条件的 imp/rand ratio 均 ≤3.8×，其中 GPQA 全部 <1.5×。Reviewers 会合理质疑：如果核心 claim 仅在一个 (model, benchmark) pair 上强，这是 robust finding 还是 idiosyncratic artifact？cross_benchmark_gradient_correlation 0.72 表明 phase gradient 本身跨 benchmark 存在 (moderate correlation)，但 strategy modulation 不 generalizable。预期 reviewer scores: Novelty 2.7 (phase gradient universality 有一定新意但被视为 'obvious once you measure it')，Soundness 3.0 (统计严格)，Significance 2.5 (practical impact unclear without method paper)，Overall 2.8。\"\n  }\n]","numLines":591,"startLine":1,"totalLines":591}}}
